                </p>
                <a href="https://integra.ifms.edu.br/portfolio/laboratorios/nuar-lab--campus-campo-grande-71" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block bg-[#C46ED8] text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-full text-lg hover:bg-[#8C40B8] transition-all duration-300 shadow-md transform hover:scale-105">Visite o NuAR.LAB</a>
